-- Phase 2 - authoritative Academic domain schema (docs/PHASE_5_MIGRATION_REPORT.md S6).
--
-- Generated by `prisma migrate diff --from-schema-datasource --to-schema-datamodel`
-- against the disposable DB AFTER Phase 1 archived the legacy academic tables,
-- then curated for D-1:
--   1. The archive tables (_academic_legacy_*) and their FK drops are NOT
--      executed (they must be preserved; see Phase 1).
--   2. Legacy EnrollmentStatus is renamed to _academic_legacy_EnrollmentStatus
--      (values preserved) and a new frozen EnrollmentStatus type is created.
--   3. Consumer FKs with preserved legacy linkages (fee_structures, invoices,
--      book_loans) are added NOT VALID; comments document each.
--   4. The attendance "exactly one of student enrollment / staff" CHECK is
--      appended (DB-invariant additive SQL per S6).
-- Creates the 32 Academic tables + enums + indexes + re-pointed consumer FKs.
